# Checked binary simplicity certificate for adjoint factor 7

Every addition, multiplication, orbit step and basis inverse below is checked
by the kernel. The initial actors are compared with the literal diagonal block
of the saved 352-dimensional action. This proves binary simplicity only;
comparison with the native invariant flag remains independent.
Source context: Guralnick--Malle I, Proposition 5.1, pp.15--16.
The original witnesses are saved in `CertificateData/source/simplicity-witnesses.json`.
